    <!-- Health Connect rationale (shown by Health Connect) -->
    <string name="health_rationale_title">Health data privacy</string>
    <string name="health_rationale_intro">GlobalFitness uses Health Connect for two things:</string>
    <string name="health_rationale_read">• Reading the data from your band or watch (for example the Xiaomi Smart Band through Mi Fitness): steps, distance, calories, heart rate, resting heart rate, heart rate variability, sleep, blood oxygen, respiratory rate and workouts. It also reads the weight and body fat recorded by other apps. With the past-data permission it imports up to one year.</string>
    <string name="health_rationale_write">• Writing your scale measurements: weight, body fat, bone mass, lean mass, basal metabolic rate and body water. If you delete a measurement in the app, it is also deleted from Health Connect.</string>
    <string name="health_rationale_storage">Data read from Health Connect is stored only on this phone: it is not uploaded to the optional cloud backup, not used for advertising and not shared with anyone. The app uses it only to show you summaries and charts.</string>
    <string name="health_rationale_revoke">You can revoke any permission at any time in Health Connect; the app stops reading that type of data and deletes its local copy on the next sync.</string>
